---
import SectionHeader from "../ui/SectionHeader.astro";
---

<section class="section why-section">
    <div class="section__inner">
        <SectionHeader
            title="Why Unity Architecture?"
            description="Most Unity projects don't fail because of gameplay. They become difficult to understand, maintain and extend as they grow."
        />

        <p class="why-section__body">
            Unity Architecture was created to help developers build games with the same engineering discipline used in professional software development.
        </p>

        <p class="why-section__body">
            Through practical architecture patterns, production-ready packages and in-depth documentation, it provides a clear path from prototype to production.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>